"公卿","official_note":"公卿泛指高级官员，如三公九卿，此处表示皇帝率领高级官员朝拜原陵，体现礼仪场合的官员参与。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"帝率公卿已下","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"92a3138b-a11c-41e5-b690-e1950058bbac"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"侍衞官","official_note":"侍衞官负责宫廷或仪式中的护卫工作，此处描述他们在神坐后守卫，确保安全。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"侍衞官皆在神坐後","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"6d1dadff-63a8-432c-8f23-0b7635d418e5"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"财政","official_name":"太官","official_note":"太官掌管宫廷膳食供应，此处负责在仪式中进献食物，体现其职责。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"太官上食","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"c03cde76-a0bc-49ba-848d-4996e5654b2c"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太常","official_note":"太常主管礼仪、祭祀和音乐，此处负责在朝拜仪式中演奏音乐，履行其文化职能。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"太常奏樂","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"c4d636d6-ab11-4a11-b809-d03e686a7155"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"郡國上計吏","official_note":"郡國上計吏是地方郡国派往中央汇报财政和民情的官员，此处他们依次上前报告谷物价格和民间疾苦，体现地方与中央的沟通。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"郡國上計吏以次前","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"08620287-e093-4d66-868a-98e89becbf5c"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"原陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"原陵","resolved_place_entity_id":2230,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"94f56c6e-db0e-11ef-af9a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1春，正月，帝率公卿已下，朝于原陵，如元會儀。乘輿拜神坐，退，坐東廂；侍衞官皆在神坐後，太官上食，太常奏樂；郡國上計吏以次前，當神軒占其郡穀價及民所疾苦。是後遂以爲常。","content_fanyi":"春季正月，明帝率领公卿以下官员到原陵朝祭，仪式如同元会。明帝向神主叩拜，然后退下，坐在东厢；侍卫官员都站在神主后面，太官进献饮食，太常演奏音乐；各郡国呈递计簿的上计吏依次上前，在供奉光武帝牌位的神轩前奏报本郡粮食价格和百姓疾苦。此后便成为常例。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，帝率公卿已下，朝于原陵，如元会仪。乘舆拜神坐，退，坐东厢；侍衞官皆在神坐后，太官上食，太常奏乐；郡国上计吏以次前，当神轩占其郡谷价及民所疾苦。是后遂以为常。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"迨后灵帝时，蔡邕从驾上陵，见其威仪，察其本意，叹明帝至孝...","context_before":"","source_end_index":43,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2e595de5-e3de-46b3-aa15-3fc8e2f40e3f","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"明帝即位之元年，率百官朝于先帝之陵，上食奏乐，郡国计吏以次占其谷价及民疾苦，遂为定制。"}],"title":"一 明帝墓祭见至孝恻隐"}],"id":3512,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94f56c68-db0e-11ef-897f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄧禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"邓禹","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"94f56c71-db0e-11ef-b641-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"諡法：行義說民曰元；主義行德曰元。此特以鄧禹中興元功而諡之耳，後世諡法始有茂德丕績曰元。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谥法：行义说民曰元；主义行德曰元。此特以邓禹中兴元功而谥之耳，后世谥法始有茂德丕绩曰元。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"94f56c70-db0e-11ef-b2d5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":2,"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"邓禹，字仲华，南阳新野人。东汉初年军事、政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10001445","link_td_number_id":740360,"people_name":"高密元侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"高密元侯","people_xingming":"邓禹","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94f56c73-db0e-11ef-88ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":2,"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"邓禹，字仲华，南阳新野人。东汉初年军事、政治人物。","link_td_id":"Q10001445","link_td_number_id":740360,"people_name":"鄧禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"邓禹","people_xingming":"邓禹","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"94f56c74-db0e-11ef-a022-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2夏，五月，高密元侯鄧禹薨。","content_fanyi":"夏季五月，高密元侯邓禹逝世。","content_jianti_auto":"2夏，五月，高密元侯邓禹薨。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references