jianti_auto":"渔阳","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"94f56cc5-db0e-11ef-a52b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"烏桓傳：赤山，在遼東西北數千里。鮮卑傳云：偏何擊漁陽赤山烏桓欽歆志賁。蓋歆志賁本赤山種而居漁陽塞外也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"乌桓传：赤山，在辽东西北数千里。鲜卑传云：偏何击渔阳赤山乌桓钦歆志贲。盖歆志贲本赤山种而居渔阳塞外也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"94f56cbb-db0e-11ef-afe1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"武威郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"武威郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94f56ccb-db0e-11ef-9e05-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94f56ccc-db0e-11ef-8fed-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"玄菟郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"玄菟郡","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"94f56ccd-db0e-11ef-9390-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"94f56cce-db0e-11ef-92f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡國志：武威郡，在雒陽西三千五百里。玄菟郡，在雒陽東北四千里。菟，同都翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡国志：武威郡，在雒阳西三千五百里。玄菟郡，在雒阳东北四千里。菟，同都翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"94f56cca-db0e-11ef-a004-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"遼東太守","official_note":"遼東太守是漢代遼東郡的最高行政長官，負責該郡的民政、軍事等事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，遼東太守祭肜派遣偏何討伐赤山烏桓，顯示其作為邊郡長官在軍事防禦和民族事務中的職責。","official_rank":"郡守級（約二千石）","source_snippet":"遼東太守祭肜使偏何討赤山烏桓","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"1fa497b3-1e4e-4c1d-82e2-4e62abb5884a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":73,"link_td_description":"祭肜，字次孙，颍川郡颍阳县（今河南省许昌市西）人，东汉政治人物。祭遵的堂弟。","link_td_id":"Q10003995","link_td_number_id":1545183,"people_name":"祭肜","people_name_jianti_auto":"祭肜","people_xingming":"祭肜","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94f56cd0-db0e-11ef-ac9d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description