"灵帝初，分为四部，各称王。建安中，辽西乌桓蹋顿有武略，总...","context_before":"...、辽东五郡塞外，为汉侦察匈奴动静，始置护乌桓校尉监领之。","source_end_index":107,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2bb05f3c-ac08-54a6-8ec3-c7e3854b1946","source_start_index":83,"source_text":"后汉初，渐为边患，辽东太守祭彤讨破之，寻皆降附。"}],"path":"北直方舆纪要/十一、万全都指挥使司开平、大宁二卫及诸裔附（卷十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","外交"],"content":"6遼東太守祭肜使偏何討赤山烏桓，大破之，斬其魁帥。塞外震讋，西自武威，東盡玄菟，皆來內附，野無風塵，乃悉罷緣邊屯兵。","content_fanyi":"辽东太守祭肜派偏何征讨赤山乌桓，大破其众，斩杀其首领。塞外各族受到震慑，西起武威，东到玄菟，都前来归附，野外再没有烽烟，于是将沿边屯兵全部撤走。","content_jianti_auto":"6辽东太守祭肜使偏何讨赤山乌桓，大破之，斩其魁帅。塞外震詟，西自武威，东尽玄菟，皆来内附，野无风尘，乃悉罢缘边屯兵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3517,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94f56cb3-db0e-11ef-a2f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"光武","people_name_jianti_auto":"光武","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94f56cd9-db0e-11ef-84b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"雒陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"雒阳","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"94f56cda-db0e-11ef-b125-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"光武建武二年，立南郊。中元元年，立北郊於雒陽城北四里。今定其冠冕、車服制度。漢官儀曰：北郊壇在城西北角，去城一里所。","note_content_jianti_auto":"光武建武二年，立南郊。中元元年，立北郊于雒阳城北四里。今定其冠冕、车服制度。汉官仪曰：北郊坛在城西北角，去城一里所。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"94f56cd8-db0e-11ef-9dce-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"記曰：歌者，在上貴人聲也，天子樂舞八佾，六十四人，八八六十四人也。佾，音逸，舞行列也。上，時掌翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"记曰：歌者，在上贵人声也，天子乐舞八佾，六十四人，八八六十四人也。佾，音逸，舞行列也。上，时掌翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"94f56cdc-db0e-11ef-a095-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"東平王","official_note":"東平王是漢代封爵，屬於地方諸侯王，此處指劉蒼，在上下文中他參與了禮樂制度的討論。","official_rank":"王爵","source_snippet":"東平王蒼以爲中興三十餘年","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"d7a7bb4e-4145-404c-9173-751f1839a0fb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":30,"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"刘苍，东汉皇子、东平宪王。汉光武帝和阴丽华之子，明帝的同母弟。","link_td_id":"Q10000925","link_td_number_id":132458,"people_name":"東平王","people_name_jianti_auto":"东平王","people_xingming":"刘苍","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94f56cde-db0e-11ef-8901-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":30,"link_death_year":83,"link_td_description":"刘苍，东汉皇子、东平宪王。汉光武帝和阴丽华之子，明帝的同母弟。","link_td_id":"Q10000925","link_td_number_id":132458,"people_name":"蒼","people_name_jianti_auto":"苍","people_xingming":"刘苍","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"94f56cdf-db0e-11ef-aeaf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"94f56cd7-db0e-11ef-81fa-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yì","source_anchor_text":"廟登歌八佾舞數上之","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":49,"text":"佾","tongjian_id":"fa52a1ba-c780-5d1f-9ce2-8a468fac835f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"光武廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"光武庙","resolved_place_entity_id":5924,"start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"94f56ce0-db0e-11ef-a595-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"7東平王蒼以爲中興三十餘年，四方無虞，宜修禮樂，乃與公卿共議定南北郊冠冕、車服制度及光武廟登歌、八佾舞數，上之。","content_fanyi":"东平王刘苍认为，自汉朝中兴以来已三十多年，四方太平无事，应当修明礼乐，于是与公卿共同商议确定南、北郊祭祀所用的冠冕、车马服饰制度，以及光武庙的登歌和八佾舞的规格，并上报朝廷。","content_jianti_auto":"7东平王苍以为中兴三十余年，四方无虞，宜修礼乐，乃与公卿共议定南北郊冠冕、车服制度及光武庙登歌、八佾舞数，上之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3518,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"94f56cd7-db0e-11ef-81fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"弇","people_name_jianti_auto":"弇","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94f7b697-db0e-11ef-9b80-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"畤，音止。諡法：在國遭憂曰愍。時國有大喪，故以諡弇，言與國同戚也。弇，古含翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"畤，音止。谥法：在国遭忧曰愍。时国有大丧，故以谥弇，言与国同戚也。弇，古含翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94f7b696-db0e-11ef-b59a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":3,"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"耿弇，字伯昭，扶风茂陵人，上谷太守耿况之子。东汉名将、军事家。","link_td_id":"Q10006242","link_td_number_id":1229789,"people_name":"好畤愍侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"好畤愍侯","people_xingming":"耿弇","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"94f7b699-db0e-11ef-8784-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":3,"link_death_year":58,"link_td_description":"耿弇，字伯昭，扶风茂陵人，上谷太守耿况之子。东汉名将、军事家。","link_td_id":"Q10006242","link_td_number_id":1229789,"people_name":"耿弇","people_name_jianti_auto":"耿弇","people_xingming":"耿弇","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"94f7b69a-db0e-11ef-bfe8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"94f7b695-db0e-11ef-a4db-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhì","source_anchor_text":"數上之好畤湣侯耿弇","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":2,"text":"畤","tongjian_id":"6d09277f-1722-5928-9d67-ca6cd2c82cfd"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"94f7b695-db0e-11ef-a4db-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yǎn","source_anchor_text":"畤湣侯耿弇薨春正月","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":6,"text":"弇","tongjian_id":"1ce3b5d5-84fb-5627-9af0-8c6935017b0b"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_refer